  "description": "Won Dae has been teased for his name ever since childhood, so he has learned not to expect niceties from those around him. The bullying got so bad, Dae had to drop out of school to recover. So when he’s due to return, his best (and only) friend Choi Yeonhoo would do anything to help him actually enjoy it. But when Won Dae meets Goo Yoonwon, things are about to go from bad, to worse, to…surprisingly good, then worse again. Who will be there at the end of the day to save our Dae?! \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
